Package: specmill
Title: Local API Wrapper Maintenance Tools
Version: 0.1.4
Authors@R: person('Sean', 'Thimons', role = c('aut', 'cre'), email = 'sxthi@outlook.com')
Description: Development tools for local schema parsing, wrapper generation,
    generated file ownership and hook validation. Generated clients retain
    their own request helpers and hook execution and need no runtime tooling.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: cli, digest, dplyr, fs, jsonlite, purrr, readr, roxygen2, stringr, tibble, tidyr, yaml
Suggests: testthat, httr2, callr, httpuv, withr, knitr, rmarkdown
VignetteBuilder: knitr
URL: https://seanthimons.github.io/specmill/, https://github.com/seanthimons/specmill
BugReports: https://github.com/seanthimons/specmill/issues
Config/Needs/website: pkgdown
